          "expr": "sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{job=\"gmp-kube-state-metrics\",namespace=\"$namespace\"}[24h]) and on(namespace,pod) (kube_pod_status_ready{job=\"gmp-kube-state-metrics\",namespace=\"$namespace\",condition=\"true\"} == 1)) or vector(0)",
